  {
    "RowOffset": 836294,
    "RowId": 44100,
    "Text": "At long last, the decisive match against the grand champion!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836366,
    "RowId": 44101,
    "Text": "Will the challenger triumph and seize the Tyrant's throne?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836438,
    "RowId": 44102,
    "Text": "First, I shall take your measure."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836482,
    "RowId": 44103,
    "Text": "Show me your footwork."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836518,
    "RowId": 44104,
    "Text": "It's Tyranny Time, folks! He knows no mercy, and he's never tasted defeat!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836606,
    "RowId": 44105,
    "Text": "How about this?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836634,
    "RowId": 44106,
    "Text": "The challenger's holding their own!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836682,
    "RowId": 44107,
    "Text": "Behold the essence of martial mastery!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836734,
    "RowId": 44108,
    "Text": "I beg your pardon? What is he going to do with all those weapons?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836810,
    "RowId": 44109,
    "Text": "Absolute brutality! The champion's power is unmatched!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836878,
    "RowId": 44110,
    "Text": "There is much more to come!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836918,
    "RowId": 44111,
    "Text": "It has been a long time since I've enjoyed myself so!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 836982,
    "RowId": 44112,
    "Text": "No more holding back."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837014,
    "RowId": 44113,
    "Text": "Prepare yourself, unenhanced warrior!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837062,
    "RowId": 44114,
    "Text": "Such ferocity! The champion is ruthless indeed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837122,
    "RowId": 44115,
    "Text": "My reign is absolute! I will not lose!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837174,
    "RowId": 44116,
    "Text": "Rrraaah!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837194,
    "RowId": 44117,
    "Text": "The Tyrant's altered his form! He looks even more tyrannical than before!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837278,
    "RowId": 44118,
    "Text": "Know the folly of challenging me unenhanced!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837334,
    "RowId": 44119,
    "Text": "Now fall!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837354,
    "RowId": 44120,
    "Text": "What a display of power! He's unleashed the full might of the behemoth!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837438,
    "RowId": 44121,
    "Text": "I will not yield my throne!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837478,
    "RowId": 44122,
    "Text": "Oh, he's split the ring in half! We're going to need urgent repairs!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837558,
    "RowId": 44123,
    "Text": "Try this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837578,
    "RowId": 44124,
    "Text": "And now he's thrown the ring! What absurd strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837642,
    "RowId": 44125,
    "Text": "Ahem, the ring shall presently be restored."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837698,
    "RowId": 44126,
    "Text": "The power of feral souls makes the Arcadion what it is!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837766,
    "RowId": 44127,
    "Text": "'Tis a clash between feral pride and mortal resolve! Either side could come out on top!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837866,
    "RowId": 44128,
    "Text": "Haaah...haaah..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837894,
    "RowId": 44129,
    "Text": "Do not underestimate the Arcadion!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837942,
    "RowId": 44130,
    "Text": "Defeat the Tyrant"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 837970,
    "RowId": 44200,
    "Text": "Defeat the Xtremes"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838002,
    "RowId": 44201,
    "Text": "This will be a tag team match of extreme proportions!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838066,
    "RowId": 44202,
    "Text": "I can handle you alone."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838102,
    "RowId": 44203,
    "Text": "My word, such scorn for the challenger!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838154,
    "RowId": 44204,
    "Text": "I ride the inferno."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838186,
    "RowId": 44205,
    "Text": "What fearsome flames! He's set the ring ablaze!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838246,
    "RowId": 44206,
    "Text": "The flames are spreading! At this rate, the challenger will be trapped!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838330,
    "RowId": 44207,
    "Text": "I'll wipe you out."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838362,
    "RowId": 44208,
    "Text": "Hey, save some fun for me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838402,
    "RowId": 44209,
    "Text": "Deep Blue's lost his cool! He's tagging in!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838458,
    "RowId": 44210,
    "Text": "If there ain't a wave to ride, just make one yourself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838526,
    "RowId": 44211,
    "Text": "Good gods, what an enormous wave!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838570,
    "RowId": 44212,
    "Text": "Bet you've never seen anything this gnarly!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838626,
    "RowId": 44213,
    "Text": "Ugh, what a drag! Let's do this together, bro!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838686,
    "RowId": 44214,
    "Text": "Both brothers have entered the ring! That's grounds for disqualification!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838770,
    "RowId": 44215,
    "Text": "They don't fight alone either, so it's only fair!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838830,
    "RowId": 44216,
    "Text": "The Xtremes fight as one!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838866,
    "RowId": 44217,
    "Text": "Hrrraah!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838886,
    "RowId": 44218,
    "Text": "Rrruaaah!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 838906,
    "RowId": 44219,
    "Text": "Er, it seems the referee is allowing it... It's double trouble for the challenger!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839002,
    "RowId": 44220,
    "Text": "We're just getting started!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839042,
    "RowId": 44221,
    "Text": "Check out this smooth teamwork! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839086,
    "RowId": 44222,
    "Text": "The brothers have triggered a fusion explosion! Truly, they're deadly when mixed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839178,
    "RowId": 44223,
    "Text": "I've been saving this trick just for you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839230,
    "RowId": 44224,
    "Text": "Brace yourselves, folks! The Xtremes are holding nothing back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839306,
    "RowId": 44225,
    "Text": "I'm not finished with you yet!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839350,
    "RowId": 44226,
    "Text": "Eat this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839370,
    "RowId": 44227,
    "Text": "Feel the burn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839398,
    "RowId": 44228,
    "Text": "Rrruah!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839418,
    "RowId": 44229,
    "Text": "You're goin' down!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839450,
    "RowId": 44230,
    "Text": "Hmph!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839466,
    "RowId": 44231,
    "Text": "Yaaagh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839486,
    "RowId": 44232,
    "Text": "You are nothing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839514,
    "RowId": 44233,
    "Text": "That all you got, huh? Nice knowing you, unenhanced warrior!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839586,
    "RowId": 44300,
    "Text": "<If(GreaterThan(IntegerParameter(2),0))>★<Else/>\u3000</If><switch(IntegerParameter(1),<Icon>51</Icon>,<Icon>52</Icon>,<Icon>53</Icon>)>The <sheet(GrandCompany,IntegerParameter(1),0)>\nTactical Rating"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839686,
    "RowId": 44301,
    "Text": "Eliminate the opposition and claim triumphs!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839742,
    "RowId": 44302,
    "Text": "<sheet(PlaceName,IntegerParameter(1),0)>\n<switch(IntegerParameter(2),Rank B,Rank A,Rank S)>\n<switch(IntegerParameter(3),Activating in: <Num>IntegerParameter(4)</Num>:<Sec>IntegerParameter(5)</Sec>,Unclaimed,Claimed <Icon>51</Icon>,Claimed <Icon>52</Icon>,Claimed <Icon>53</Icon>)>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839902,
    "RowId": 44303,
    "Text": "Come to me, snowkin! Join the fun!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839950,
    "RowId": 44304,
    "Text": "We shall make snowmen─lots of them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 839998,
    "RowId": 44305,
    "Text": "Ahhh, such fun that was! Let us play again soon!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 840058,
    "RowId": 44306,
    "Text": "With you we share our joy! A gift snowy and sparkly!"
  },
